1466
02:07:47,201 --> 02:07:50,953
Morse, shut that door!

1467
02:07:51,037 --> 02:07:53,247
- Now!
- Shut the fucking door!

1468
02:07:55,333 --> 02:07:58,420
- [ Hisses ]
- I'm going for the lead!

1469
02:08:09,180 --> 02:08:10,724
[ Hisses ]

1470
02:08:13,269 --> 02:08:15,103
[ Grunting ]

1471
02:08:25,989 --> 02:08:28,783
[ Screeching ]

1472
02:08:34,497 --> 02:08:36,916
- Go! Now!
- What about you?

1473
02:08:37,001 --> 02:08:40,336
- I'm staying.
- Bullshit! There's gonna be
1 0 tons of hot lead in there!

1474
02:08:40,462 --> 02:08:43,547
I keep telling you, I want to die!
We got a deal!

1475
02:08:43,631 --> 02:08:46,176
Remember? It dies first, then you!

1476
02:08:46,260 --> 02:08:48,970
I'm not gonna move without you!
Now get going!

1477
02:08:52,015 --> 02:08:54,434
[ Hisses ]

1478
02:09:04,819 --> 02:09:07,572
- Dillon!
- I've got to hold it here.

1479
02:09:07,655 --> 02:09:10,617
- What about me?
- God will take care of you now, sister!

1480
02:09:10,701 --> 02:09:12,618
No!

1481
02:09:12,703 --> 02:09:14,621
Pour the lead.

1482
02:09:21,921 --> 02:09:23,837
- Fuck you.
- [ Hisses ]

1483
02:09:26,216 --> 02:09:31,720
[ Screaming ]
Go on! Pour it, Ripley! Go on! Damn it!

1484
02:09:31,805 --> 02:09:34,265
Pour that lead, Ripley!
Pour it now!

1485
02:09:34,350 --> 02:09:37,476
Come on! Come on!
That's all you've got?

1486
02:09:37,560 --> 02:09:39,854
Is that all that you fight,
motherfucker! Come on!

1487
02:09:39,979 --> 02:09:43,399
Morse! Morse, over here!
[ Screaming Continues ]

1488
02:09:45,319 --> 02:09:47,862
- Ripley!
- Pour the lead!

1489
02:09:49,114 --> 02:09:51,490
- Pour the lead!
- [ Screaming ]

1490
02:09:51,574 --> 02:09:52,658
Pour it!

1491
02:10:01,292 --> 02:10:03,837
- [ Grunting ]
- [ Grunting ]

1492
02:10:45,253 --> 02:10:48,506
[ Laughing ]

1493
02:10:48,591 --> 02:10:50,091
I hate bugs!

1494
02:10:51,926 --> 02:10:54,304
[ Screeches ]

1495
02:11:03,646 --> 02:11:05,899
[ Hissing ]

1496
02:11:12,698 --> 02:11:15,742
[ Grunting ]

1497
02:11:16,743 --> 02:11:19,537
Ripley! It's burning hot!

1498
02:11:19,622 --> 02:11:23,082
Hit the sprinklers!

1499
02:11:23,167 --> 02:11:25,627
Douse the fucker!

1500
02:11:25,711 --> 02:11:28,128
[ Gasps ]

1501
02:11:33,761 --> 02:11:36,304
- [ Hissing ]
- [ Grunts ]

1502
02:11:48,108 --> 02:11:51,485
[ Screeching ]

1503
02:11:58,284 --> 02:11:59,827
Gotcha!

1504
02:12:00,912 --> 02:12:02,579
Yes!

1505
02:12:26,689 --> 02:12:28,355
[ Coughing ]

1506
02:12:32,360 --> 02:13:05,726
[ Gasps ]

1507
02:13:07,729 --> 02:13:11,274
- [ Ripley ] Don't come any closer.
- Wait. They're here to help.

1508
02:13:11,358 --> 02:13:12,899
Stay where you are!

1509
02:13:15,988 --> 02:13:19,323
- Ripley.
- Bishop.

1510
02:13:19,408 --> 02:13:21,908
I'm here to help you.
No more bullshit.

1511
02:13:21,993 --> 02:13:24,578
I just felt it move.

1512
02:13:24,662 --> 02:13:27,998
- You know who I am?
- You're a droid.

1513
02:13:28,082 --> 02:13:31,085
Same model as Bishop.
Sent by the fucking company.

1514
02:13:31,170 --> 02:13:35,213
No. I'm not the Bishop android.

1515
02:13:35,298 --> 02:13:37,550
I designed it.

1516
02:13:37,634 --> 02:13:40,136
I'm very human.

1517
02:13:40,220 --> 02:13:42,512
The company sent me here
to show you a friendly face,

1518
02:13:42,597 --> 02:13:46,350
to demonstrate
how important you are to us,

1519
02:13:46,435 --> 02:13:48,060
to me.

1520
02:13:48,145 --> 02:13:51,396
- You just want to take it back.
- We want to kill it and take you home.

1521
02:13:51,481 --> 02:13:55,984
- Bullshit.
- You're wrong.
We want to help.

1522
02:13:56,069 --> 02:13:58,988
What does that mean?

1523
02:13:59,113 --> 02:14:03,283
We're gonna take that out of you.
And keep it.

1524
02:14:03,368 --> 02:14:07,287
Can't allow it to live.
Everything we know would be in jeopardy.

1525
02:14:09,457 --> 02:14:11,708
You don't want to take it back?

1526
02:14:11,793 --> 02:14:17,547
Ripley, time is important.
Let us deal with the malignancy.

1527
02:14:17,632 --> 02:14:21,676
We've got a surgical bay
set up on the rescue ship.

1528
02:14:21,804 --> 02:14:25,390
Come with me.
It's very quick.

1529
02:14:25,474 --> 02:14:30,770
Painless. A couple of incisions.
You'll be out for two hours.

1530
02:14:33,399 --> 02:14:35,274
And then it's over.

1531
02:14:40,655 --> 02:14:45,701
You still can have a life, children-

1532
02:14:47,412 --> 02:14:50,497
And most important,
you'll know it's dead.

1533
02:14:50,582 --> 02:14:52,958
Let me help you.

1534
02:14:54,002 --> 02:14:56,503
What guarantee do I have...

1535
02:14:58,465 --> 02:15:02,760
once you've taken it out,
you'll destroy it?

1536
02:15:02,845 --> 02:15:05,637
You have to trust me.

1537
02:15:10,769 --> 02:15:14,020
Please? Trust me?

1538
02:15:18,734 --> 02:15:20,528
No.

1539
02:15:30,747 --> 02:15:33,457
- What's this gonna achieve?
- [ Screams ]

1540
02:15:33,542 --> 02:15:36,461
- Stop!
- Ow! Oh, Jesus!

1541
02:15:36,545 --> 02:15:39,713
[ Groaning ]
Morse.

1542
02:15:42,176 --> 02:15:46,345
Will you help me?
What do you want me to do?

1543
02:15:49,475 --> 02:15:52,894
It was a mistake!
There was no need for any of it!

1544
02:15:52,978 --> 02:15:54,270
Fucking android!

1545
02:16:12,914 --> 02:16:14,582
I'm not a droid!

1546
02:16:18,462 --> 02:16:22,923
Ripley, think of all
we could learn from it.

1547
02:16:23,007 --> 02:16:26,135
It's the chance of a lifetime!

1548
02:16:26,220 --> 02:16:31,224
You must let me have it!
It's a magnificent specimen!

1549
02:16:32,433 --> 02:16:34,977
Oh, Jesus!

1550
02:16:36,271 --> 02:16:38,104
No pictures!

1551
02:17:06,676 --> 02:17:08,927
You're crazy.

1552
02:17:09,012 --> 02:17:11,763
What are you doing?

1553
02:17:20,231 --> 02:17:22,608
No!

1554
02:18:21,167 --> 02:18:22,752
[ Grunts ]
[ Chuckles ]

1555
02:18:22,878 --> 02:18:26,379
Come on, you. Get going.
Oh, fuck you!

1556
02:18:29,593 --> 02:18:32,844
[ Static ]

1557
02:18:32,929 --> 02:18:36,264
[ Ripley's Voice ]
Ash, Captain Dallas are dead.

1558
02:18:36,350 --> 02:18:40,144
Cargo and ship destroyed.

1559
02:18:40,227 --> 02:18:44,440
I should reach the frontier
in about six weeks.

1560
02:18:44,523 --> 02:18:48,235
With a little luck,
the network will pick me up.

1561
02:18:48,319 --> 02:18:50,279
This is Ripley,

1562
02:18:50,363 --> 02:18:53,907
last survivor of the Nostromo,
signing off.

1563
02:18:55,284 --> 02:18:56,869
[ Beeping ]

1564
02:24:42,549 --> 02:24:43,549
English - US - PSDH
